#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:85 templates/tasks/tutorials.html:111
msgid "Step 1"
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:86
msgid ""
"Click on the <strong>\"+\" (plus)</strong> icon or the <strong>\"Add Task\"</"
"strong> button on the top bar."
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:89 templates/tasks/tutorials.html:115
msgid "Step 2"
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:90
msgid ""
"Fill in the <strong>Name</strong> and <strong>Description</strong> of the "
"task. These should be clear so the executor understands the goal."
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:93 templates/tasks/tutorials.html:119
msgid "Step 3"
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:94
msgid ""
"Set the <strong>Estimated Time</strong> (Days and Hours) and the "
"<strong>Difficulty</strong> level."
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:97 templates/tasks/tutorials.html:123
msgid "Step 4"
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:98
msgid "Add participants:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:100
msgid "Stakeholder:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:100
msgid "Who will evaluate the task."
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:101
msgid "Executor:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:101
msgid "Who will perform the work."
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:105
msgid "Step 5"
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:106
msgid ""
"Click <strong>\"Submit\"</strong> to save. The executor will be notified (if "
"invited by email) or see the task in their Inbox."
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:109
msgid "2. How to Execute and Evaluate a Task"
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:112
msgid ""
"Go to your <strong>Inbox</strong> (Main page). Locate the task and click on "
"the <strong>Status badge</strong> (e.g., \"Doing\") to change it."
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:116
msgid ""
"When the work is finished, click on the status badge and select "
"<strong>\"Done\"</strong>."
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:120
msgid ""
"A popup will appear asking for your <strong>Effectiveness Rating</strong>. "
"Choose a value from 1 to 5 based on how well you performed the task under "
"current conditions."
msgstr ""

#: templates/tasks/tutorials.html:124
msgid ""
"After clicking a rating, the task status will update to <strong>Done</"
"strong>, and the Stakeholder will be able to provide their final evaluation."
msgstr ""

